id: pm-ado-ci-wrapper-child-timeout
title: Investigate linked-test wrapper retaining children after timeout
description: "During Fleet CI v2 validation, a linked command failed at the default 120-second pm watchdog while its timeout/Node descendant processes remained alive beyond that deadline. The abandoned process tree was explicitly terminated. Reproduce with synthetic fixtures, deduplicate upstream reports, and verify descendant cleanup without changing package behavior."
